{"t": 1795081253.7264538, "tool": "analyze", "code": "import numpy as np\nA=np.column_stack([np.ones_like(eps),np.log(eps),np.log(T)])\nc,res,_,_=np.linalg.lstsq(A,np.log(sigma),rcond=None)\nprint(c, np.mean((np.log(sigma)-A@c)**2))\n# polynomial in eps,T fit\nB=np.column_stack([eps**i*T**j for i in range(4) for j in range(4) if i+j<=5])\nc2,_,_,_=np.linalg.lstsq(B,sigma,rcond=None)\nr=sigma-B@c2\nprint(\"poly nmse\",np.mean(r**2)/np.var(sigma))\nprint(np.corrcoef(eps,sigma)[0,1], np.corrcoef(T,sigma)[0,1])\n", "out": "[-0.94936902  0.7381637   1.44965197] 0.069821351555537\npoly nmse 4.69158893240761e-05\n0.7828207381299169 0.5690603618821346\n"}
